checks["ToComponents reordered selection"]=Simplify[First[ToComponents["N",U[-a,b,-c,-d],FreeIndices->{b,-a,-c,-d},Components->{{1,0,2,3}}]]-2 Exp[-2 t]/3]===0;
checks["Native ComponentValue returns rule"]=Last[ComponentValue[TN[{0,ch},{1,-ch},{2,-ch},{3,-ch}]]]===-7;
DeleteTensorValues[TN,{{ch,-ch,-ch,-ch}}];
checks["Deleted selected group rebuilt"]=ToValues[TN[{0,ch},{1,-ch},{2,-ch},{3,-ch}]]===-7&&Length[Last[TensorValues[TN,{{ch,-ch,-ch,-ch}}]]]===1;
Block[{xPlorer`Private`$insideManagedCalculation=True},ComponentValue[TN[{0,ch},{1,-ch},{2,-ch},{3,-ch}],99]];
checks["Native derived edit invalidates selected stamp"]=ToValues[TN[{0,ch},{1,-ch},{2,-ch},{3,-ch}]]===-7;
MetricInBasis[gN,ReplacePart[mat,{1,1}->-4]];
checks["Metric update invalidates selected value"]=ToValues[TN[{0,ch},{1,-ch},{2,-ch},{3,-ch}]]===-7/4;
ComponentValue[TN[{0,-ch},{1,-ch},{2,-ch},{3,-ch}],9];
checks["Field edit invalidates selected value"]=ToValues[TN[{0,ch},{1,-ch},{2,-ch},{3,-ch}]]===-9/4;
